<p>Infect a target's mind with a virulent whisper that deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">184, 248, 297, 339, 376</acronym> Mind damage and spreads amongst your foes, dealing damage and feeding you <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1.0, 2.3, 3.4, 4.2, 5.0</acronym> Hate for each new victim. Each turn for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 3, 3</acronym> turns, the initial victim will spread the whisper to a new target within <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> tiles if one is available; beyond this, all affected targets have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15%, 21%, 25%, 30%, 33%</acronym> chance of spreading the effect each turn for 4 turns.</p><p></p><p>Targets damaged by this ability have a 25% chance of suffering Brainlock.</p><p></p><p>The damage increases with your Mindpower.</p>